# 👋 Hi, I'm Friedrich

### Helping Pharma & Biotech Succeed with R & Shiny

I’m the **co-founder and CEO of [RPACT](https://www.rpact.com)** — a company specializing in **enterprise R/Shiny software development, consultancy, and training** for the pharmaceutical and biotech industry.  
Our mission is to help organizations successfully integrate **R** and **Shiny** into their workflows — for **regulatory compliance, data analysis, and interactive reporting**.

---

## 💼 What We Do at RPACT

🔹 **Enterprise R/Shiny Solutions** — Scalable, validated applications for regulated environments  
🔹 **Consulting & Training** — Helping clinical researchers leverage R effectively  
🔹 **Support for [rpact](https://cran.r-project.org/package=rpact)** — Our open-source R package for clinical trial design and analysis  
🔹 **Trusted by leading pharma companies** — Supporting the adoption of open-source solutions while ensuring compliance with GxP standards

---

## 🧠 About Me

With a background in **software development and IT consulting since 2008**, I combine deep technical expertise with an understanding of **regulatory and statistical requirements** in clinical research.  
At RPACT, I focus on **software architecture**, **functional design**, **implementation**, and **user experience** — helping teams build validated, production-ready solutions with R and Shiny.

